File Description
This folder contains the experimental script for the Cognitive Map and Schizotypy (cogmap-schizo) study. 
The main function of the program is RUN_ALL_TASKS.m. After running it, you will be prompted to enter the participant ID (must be a numeric value), followed by the group assignment (image / language) and the session (day1 / day2). 
In our actual study, all participants completed the experiment on day1. 
Before running the experiment, please ensure that Psychtoolbox is properly installed (http://psychtoolbox.org/). 
The version used in our study is Psychtoolbox 3–3.0.19.10.
